why: gw-monolith-decompose, second slice. control.rs is 263 small route handlers, not one
     component — so it splits by FAMILY. Measured: the matrix family is 35 items / 556 lines
     (12%) and calls exactly three shared helpers (json_err 2×, safe_path_seg 4×, state_dir 1×).
     `status`/`serve` showed up as dependencies only because the tool matched bare NAMES, not
     calls — a false positive worth remembering.
